# Corpus-diversity single-block combat: Axebane Stag (6/7) attacks,
# Borderland Minotaur (4/3) blocks -- vanilla stats, no keywords, the blocker dies (6 >= 3 toughness), the attacker survives.
# CR 510.1b: a single live blocker exchanges full power for full power
# automatically, no decision needed (dealAttackerDamage, combatdamage.go).
startturn human
advance 5
queue attackers 1
declareattackers
advance
queue blocks 2=1
declareblockers
advance
advance
combatdamage
# One more advance for the state-based-action check that moves the
# lethally damaged creature(s) to the graveyard.
advance
